{"schema_version":"talkami_spoken_audio_manifest_v2","theme_id":"10.01","status":"audio_not_recorded","main_count":149,"reply_count":29,"alternative_count":10,"total_audio_count":188,"audio_naming":"${id}.mp3","entries":[{"id":"10.01.01-S001","kind":"main","cn":"您好，几位用餐？","meaning_my":"မင်္ဂလာပါ၊ လူဘယ်နှယောက် စားမှာလဲ။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"两位，谢谢。","meaning_my":"နှစ်ယောက်ပါ၊ ကျေးဇူးတင်ပါတယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"请问几位？","meaning_my":"တဆိတ်လောက်၊ လူဘယ်နှယောက်ပါလဲ။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S002","kind":"main","cn":"您提前订位了吗？","meaning_my":"စားပွဲ ကြိုတင်ဘိုကင်လုပ်ထားလား။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S002_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"没有，直接过来的。","meaning_my":"မမှာထားဘူး၊ ဒီအတိုင်းလာတာပါ။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S002_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S003","kind":"main","cn":"我们没预约。","meaning_my":"စားပွဲ ကြိုမမှာထားပါဘူး။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S004","kind":"main","cn":"现在没位子，要等一会儿。","meaning_my":"အခု စားပွဲလွတ် မရှိသေးလို့ ခဏစောင့်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S005","kind":"main","cn":"要取号等位吗？","meaning_my":"နံပါတ်ယူပြီး စောင့်ရမလား။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S006","kind":"main","cn":"您这边请。","meaning_my":"ဒီဘက် ကြွပါ။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S006_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"请跟我来。","meaning_my":"ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မနောက် လိုက်ခဲ့ပါ။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S006_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S007","kind":"main","cn":"您坐里面还是外面？","meaning_my":"အထဲမှာ ထိုင်မလား၊ အပြင်မှာ ထိုင်မလား။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S008","kind":"main","cn":"有包间吗？","meaning_my":"သီးသန့်အခန်း ရှိလား။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S009","kind":"main","cn":"有儿童椅吗？","meaning_my":"ကလေးထိုင်ခုံ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S010","kind":"main","cn":"您先看看菜单。","meaning_my":"မီနူးကို အရင် ကြည့်ပါဦး။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S011","kind":"main","cn":"有图片菜单吗？","meaning_my":"ပုံပါတဲ့ မီနူး ရှိလား။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S012","kind":"main","cn":"现在可以点菜了吗？","meaning_my":"အခု ဟင်းမှာလို့ ရပြီလား။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S012_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"再等一下，我们还没选好。","meaning_my":"ခဏစောင့်ပါဦး၊ မရွေးရသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S012_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"您有忌口或过敏的食物吗？","meaning_my":"ရှောင်ရတဲ့အစားအစာ ဒါမှမဟုတ် ဓာတ်မတည့်တဲ့အစားအစာ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我对花生过敏，麻烦确认一下。","meaning_my":"မြေပဲနဲ့ ဓာတ်မတည့်လို့ သေချာစစ်ပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S014","kind":"main","cn":"我们对花生过敏。","meaning_my":"ကျွန်တော်တို့ မြေပဲနဲ့ ဓာတ်မတည့်ဘူး။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S015","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜辣不辣？","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်း စပ်လား။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S016","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜大概要等二十分钟。","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်းက မိနစ်နှစ်ဆယ်လောက် စောင့်ရမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S017","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜卖完了。","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်း ကုန်သွားပြီ။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S017_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"那我换一道吧。","meaning_my":"ဒါဆို တခြားဟင်းတစ်ပွဲ ပြောင်းမှာမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S017_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S018","kind":"main","cn":"等等，我还想加个菜。","meaning_my":"ခဏဦး၊ ဟင်းတစ်ပွဲ ထပ်မှာချင်သေးတယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S019","kind":"main","cn":"再来两碗米饭。","meaning_my":"ထမင်း နှစ်ပွဲ ထပ်ပေးပါ။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S020","kind":"main","cn":"点好了，就这些。","meaning_my":"မှာပြီးပါပြီ၊ ဒါပဲ။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.01-S020_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，我先帮您下单。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ အော်ဒါ အရင်တင်ပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.01-S020_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S001","kind":"main","cn":"您的菜来了。","meaning_my":"မှာထားတဲ့ဟင်း ရောက်လာပါပြီ။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S002","kind":"main","cn":"您慢用。","meaning_my":"အေးဆေး သုံးဆောင်ပါ။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S003","kind":"main","cn":"我帮您加点水。","meaning_my":"ရေ နည်းနည်း ထပ်ဖြည့်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S004","kind":"main","cn":"我帮您把空盘子收走吧。","meaning_my":"ပန်းကန်အလွတ်တွေ သိမ်းပေးပါမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S005","kind":"main","cn":"麻烦再加一套餐具。","meaning_my":"ဇွန်းနဲ့ တူ တစ်စုံ ထပ်ယူလာပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S006","kind":"main","cn":"帮我换个干净盘子。","meaning_my":"သန့်တဲ့ ပန်းကန်တစ်ချပ် လဲပေးပါ။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S007","kind":"main","cn":"菜还没上齐。","meaning_my":"မှာထားတဲ့ဟင်းတွေ အကုန် မရောက်သေးဘူး။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S008","kind":"main","cn":"能帮我催一下吗？","meaning_my":"လိုက်မေးပေးလို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，我去厨房问一下。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ မီးဖိုချောင်ကို သွားမေးပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S008_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"麻烦催一下菜。","meaning_my":"ဟင်းလေး အမြန်ရအောင် လိုက်ပြောပေးပါဦး။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S008_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S009","kind":"main","cn":"我去问问厨房做好没有。","meaning_my":"မီးဖိုချောင်မှာ ချက်ပြီးပြီလား သွားမေးပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S010","kind":"main","cn":"我去帮您催一下。","meaning_my":"အမြန်လုပ်ပေးဖို့ သွားပြောပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S011","kind":"main","cn":"这道菜还要五分钟。","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်း နောက်ထပ် ငါးမိနစ်လောက် လိုသေးတယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S012","kind":"main","cn":"这菜不是我们点的。","meaning_my":"ဒီဟင်းကို ကျွန်တော်တို့ မမှာထားဘူး။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S012_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"不好意思，我核对一下订单。","meaning_my":"အားနာပါတယ်၊ အော်ဒါကို ပြန်စစ်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S012_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S013","kind":"main","cn":"肉好像没熟。","meaning_my":"အသား မကျက်သေးသလိုပဲ။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S013_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先别吃了，我请厨房确认。","meaning_my":"အရင် မစားပါနဲ့ဦး၊ မီးဖိုချောင်ကို သေချာစစ်ခိုင်းမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S013_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S014","kind":"main","cn":"我这就帮您换一份。","meaning_my":"အခုချက်ချင်း တစ်ပွဲ လဲပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"10.01.02-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.01.02-S015","kind":"main","cn":"账单好像算错了。","meaning_my":"ဘေလ် တွက်မှားနေသလိုပဲ။",